    "project_purpose": "Zircuit Staking is a Zircuit Liquidity Hub and farming/staking rewards program where users deposit supported assets to earn staking or restaking APR, Zircuit points, partner points, and potential airdrop rewards. rsETH may be one supported deposit asset, but the protocol should not be described as issuing rsETH unless supported by primary documentation and contract ownership evidence. Broader Zircuit rollup, bridge, OFT/token, and institutional/compliance lending infrastructure should be separated from the zircuit-staking product scope unless directly proven to be part of its TVL surface.",
